><span begin="00:08.490" end="00:09.660">trees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.170" end="00:12.810"><span begin="00:10.170" end="00:10.410">But </span><span begin="00:10.410" end="00:10.710">I </span><span begin="00:10.710" end="00:10.950">just </span><span begin="00:10.950" end="00:11.640">see </span><span begin="00:11.640" end="00:11.820">the </span><span begin="00:11.820" end="00:12.810">memories</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.810" end="00:18.570"><span begin="00:12.810" end="00:13.560">as </span><span begin="00:13.560" end="00:13.800">they </span><span begin="00:13.800" end="00:15.180">come</span><span begin="00:15.180" end="00:15.870">, </span><span begin="00:15.870" end="00:16.650">as </span><span begin="00:16.650" end="00:17.010">they </span><span begin="00:17.010" end="00:18.570">come</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.990" end="00:24.150"><span begin="00:18.990" end="00:19.470">And </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.710">I </span><span begin="00:19.710" end="00:20.250">couldn't </span><span begin="00:20.250" end="00:20.970">help </span><span begin="00:20.970" end="00:21.210">but </span><span begin="00:21.210" end="00:21.870">fall </span><span begin="00:21.870" end="00:22.140">in </span><span begin="00:22.140" end="00:22.650">love </span><span begin="00:22.650" end="00:24.150">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.080" end="00:30.300"><span begin="00:25.080" end="00:25.650">No</span><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:25.650">, </span><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:25.890">I </span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.400">couldn't </span><span begin="00:26.400" end="00:27.090">help </span><span begin="00:27.090" end="00:27.330">but </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.990">fall </span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.260">in </span><span begin="00:28.260" end="00:28.770">love </span><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:30.300">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.770" end="00:35.100"><span begin="00:31.770" en